{"4137920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marble's Marbles", "steam_appid": 4137920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! Marble has lost all his marbles! It’s up to you to guide them back home. You’ll quickly find yourself immersed in a nostalgic love letter to the classic marble games of the past, reimagined with modern visuals and satisfying physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/648f0e9a956e4847bde4e21846f60167.poster.avif?t=1783036025\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/648f0e9a956e4847bde4e21846f60167.webm?t=1783036025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/648f0e9a956e4847bde4e21846f60167.mp4?t=1783036025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world presents new challenges designed to test your reflexes, quick thinking, and problem solving. From crumbling platforms and moving machines to wild contraptions and shifting landscapes, every level offers something new to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marble’s Marbles is easy to pick up, with intuitive controls and full controller support. Adjust the camera to get the perfect view as you roll, bounce, and balance your way through beautiful, physics-powered worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/50b1a4d1e3fde35ecbc2086818886870.poster.avif?t=1783036025\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/50b1a4d1e3fde35ecbc2086818886870.webm?t=1783036025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/50b1a4d1e3fde35ecbc2086818886870.mp4?t=1783036025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in the charm of rolling adventures, stunning environments, and playful challenges that celebrate the joy of the classics and help Marble find his marbles again!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! Marble has lost all his marbles! It’s up to you to guide them back home. You’ll quickly find yourself immersed in a nostalgic love letter to the classic marble games of the past, reimagined with modern visuals and satisfying physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/648f0e9a956e4847bde4e21846f60167.poster.avif?t=1783036025\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/648f0e9a956e4847bde4e21846f60167.webm?t=1783036025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/648f0e9a956e4847bde4e21846f60167.mp4?t=1783036025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world presents new challenges designed to test your reflexes, quick thinking, and problem solving. From crumbling platforms and moving machines to wild contraptions and shifting landscapes, every level offers something new to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marble’s Marbles is easy to pick up, with intuitive controls and full controller support. Adjust the camera to get the perfect view as you roll, bounce, and balance your way through beautiful, physics-powered worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/50b1a4d1e3fde35ecbc2086818886870.poster.avif?t=1783036025\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/50b1a4d1e3fde35ecbc2086818886870.webm?t=1783036025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/extras/50b1a4d1e3fde35ecbc2086818886870.mp4?t=1783036025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in the charm of rolling adventures, stunning environments, and playful challenges that celebrate the joy of the classics and help Marble find his marbles again!</p>", "short_description": "A love letter to the classic marble games. Help Marble find his lost marbles and roll through physics-powered worlds packed with wild challenges and quirky contraptions.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/50629af3de898e09dd3d1b21434c38254ca94c75/header.jpg?t=1783036025", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/d995c2190df75f3ae987b289643fa05f577fc590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783036025", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137920/d995c2190df75f3ae987b289643fa05f577fc590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783036025", "website": "http://www.destined.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support (Intel Core i5 or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<